pv_what_t:'What we store',pv_what:'Only what you enter or import: accounts, operations, goals, settings. If you create an account: your email and password (stored encrypted, never readable). The app never connects to your bank and never asks for your banking credentials. No ads, no trackers, no behaviour analytics.',
pv_where_t:'Where your data lives',pv_where:'In guest mode: only on your device. With an account: also in a database hosted in the European Union (Ireland), so you can find your data on several devices. Traffic is encrypted (HTTPS).',
pv_who_t:'Who can see it',pv_who:'Only you: each account can only read and edit its own data (isolation at database level). Your data is neither sold nor shared. It is not end-to-end encrypted: the publisher technically has administrator access to the database and commits not to look at the content of your data.',
pv_imp_t:'Importing a statement or invoice',pv_imp:'The file is read on your phone: it is not sent over the Internet. Only the operations you tick and confirm are saved (date, amount, label, category). Check the labels: they may contain names or references. You can also enter things by hand, with no file at all.',
pv_sec_t:'Security',pv_sec:'Encrypted connection, protection against embedding in other sites, no script or font loaded from third-party sites, encrypted passwords, per-user access isolation. Choose a long, unique password.',
pv_third_t:'Services used',pv_third:'App hosting (Netlify), database and sign-in (Supabase, EU). For the exchange rate, a request with no personal data is sent to a public exchange-rate service.',
pv_rights_t:'Your rights',pv_rights:'Access and copy: export your data as CSV or backup in Settings. Rectification: edit it in the app. Erasure: “Delete my account and data” in Settings, immediate and permanent. You may also contact your data-protection authority (in France, cnil.fr).',
pv_keep_t:'Retention',pv_keep:'Your data is kept as long as your account exists. Deleting your account erases it from the database. In guest mode it stays on your device until you clear it.',
